100 Continue — The request and is waiting for the rest.
• 101 Switching Protocols — As requested by the client.
• 102 Processing — The request and is in the process of carrying it out.
• 200 OK — All good.
• 201 Created — Resource successfully created.
• 204 No Content — Success, nothing to return.
• 400 Bad Request — Client-side error.
• 401 Unauthorized — Authentication required.
• 403 Forbidden — Access denied.
• 404 Not Found — Resource does not exist.
• 409 Conflict — Resource conflict or duplicate.
• 500 Internal Server Error — Server-side issue.
• 502 / 503 / 504 — Gateway error / service unavailable / timeout.
